  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "Firecrackers are anti-air defenses in the Builder Base. They are the Builder Base version of the Air Defense that are unlocked at Builder Hall level 3. Like the Air Defense, they attack flying units; however, they are slightly less powerful while also being slightly smaller, covering a 2×2 space."
  ],
